cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CADCLAW in your research or engineering work, please cite it as below."
title: "CADCLAW: Automated validation framework for STEP-based CAD assemblies"
abstract: >-
  CADCLAW is an automated validation and analysis framework for STEP
  assemblies, providing interference detection, inventory checks,
  adjacency rules, dimensional gates, kinematics, tolerance stacking
  (worst-case / RSS / Monte Carlo), and disassembly-sequence rendering.
  Includes an MCP server exposing all gates to AI coding assistants.
